9VxVEwZk6VfSNRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEPAryP7byNQVDzMBygsc87X3yMybPgtfPb_VnLy9T_bg&oe=6A95D523"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "screen3.png", "id": "458598088952441", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974871_458598092285774_5159038276755156810_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mfYh2FOCdisQ7kNvwEa3Dcp&_nc_oc=AdoLd5J1kOexyzqsLqJpQNI1ZF8RUR0y9YfLy6N3IUTAHVrs1dQvoxzVJX7SAXH3Mos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEr3AzqV00_3fVDeHIpIbqxYWg7lRWurc5Icgoazu3Thw&oe=6A95CC57"}, "display_name": "ZOSULand 20ZZ", "keywords": ["Parkour", "jetpack", "cyberpunk", "Climb", "City"], "long_description": "Zany ZOSULand Experience\n\nClimb, fly, grapple over 10 square miles / 28 kilometers of futuristic urban areas in order to save each floating city and the multitude of animals from the invading forces.\n\nOctober 2024 Update: added setting change option for Quest3 or higher device, various performance improvements also made.\n\n- 27 unique city levels + 9 bonus levels to fly through space \n- Over 250 building types to explore and over 40 types of animals to save\n- Jetpacks allow flight, grapples in each level available, and you can climb almost anything anywhere\n- Destroy robots and dinosaurs\n- Motion Sickness Consideration: all horizontal turning can be done using the right joystick in addition to the direction you are looking, while flying move in direction of hand/jetpack.\n*Additional 5/23/2022 updates: major game mechanics improvements, new random level selector, level end-scenes with score and animal viewing, added multiple songs, added new animal spawns / animations and some random spawns*", "short_description": "-Zany ZOSULand Experience:\n-Climb, fly, grapple over 10 miles / 28 kilometers of futuristic urban areas to save each floating city and the multitude of animals\n- 27 unique city levels + 9 bonus levels\n- Over 2